    Returns:
    --------
    None (displays the plot)

    Examples:
    ---------
    # Example 1: Simple nested structure
    data1 = {
        "user": {
            "metrics": {
                "scores": [85, 90, 78, 92, 88]
            }
        }
    }
    extract_and_visualize_json_data(data1, ["user", "metrics", "scores"])

    # Example 2: List of objects
    data2 = {
        "results": [
            {"value": 10, "name": "A"},
